      "@id": "#claim",
      "@type": "Claim",
      "name": "Entry 11: general review — code fixes, and what they moved",
      "text": "A 13-agent adversarially-verified review fixed a latent KE-floor bug (unreachable by any benchmark ride), the measuredFlatSpeed/epsFromBalance VSTOP gate (the one fix with real effect: censo ε_true 0.14 → 0.23), compressed-timestamp FIT decoding, signed drag in flatEqSpeed, and the app's interleaved-record loader; no published headline conclusion reversed. Methodological correction: the ε correlations (0.83/0.87) are part–whole — the honest statistic is RMS skill vs a flat baseline.",
